WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.929
Before creating a static pivot inspect the category
values This

00:00:05.942 --> 00:00:11.496
script lists distinct diagnoses and products If the
current data

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:17.991
includes categories you did not plan for a fixed
pivot may omit them Discovery

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:20.333
helps make the schema decision explicit
